    {
        "content": "<p><span aria-label=\"speech balloon\" class=\"emoji emoji-1f4ac\" role=\"img\" title=\"speech balloon\">:speech_balloon:</span> cfallin created <a href=\"https://github.com/bytecodealliance/wasmtime/pull/15182#discussion_r4496676677\">PR review comment</a>:</p>\n<blockquote>\n<p>Rather than doing a binary search for each PC as we walk through PCs, it's probably more efficient to add an accessor to <code>compiled_module</code> that returns its offset-range, and test whether <code>patch.offset</code> is within that range, no? Or perhaps <code>compiled_module().contains_offset(patch.offset)</code> actually, with the range-contains comparisons?</p>\n</blockquote>",
